### Overall Assessment

**This is the strongest chapter so far.** It's well-scoped, uses memorable examples, and builds statistical reasoning skills that are foundational for everything that follows. The FPP-derived content is excellent pedagogy.

The main weaknesses are cosmetic (typos, hidden code) and connective (missing explicit ML links). The core content needs minimal revision.

This chapter demonstrates what the book does well: using real examples to build intuition about why statistical reasoning matters. If Chapters 1-2 could achieve this level of focus and narrative coherence, Part 1 would be very strong.

